  syntax  : "uses Alias from \"std/behaviors/std-modal\""
  desc    : "Import a behavior. The alias is used in entity/trait/page/orbital references like Alias.entity / Alias.traits.X / Alias.pages.X / Alias.orbitals.X. See uses-file-scope and uses-config for the two extra shapes this declaration takes."
